(Bug #63. A `To` with no `Return` at all answers with nothing -
 LANGUAGE.md:684-686 defines exactly this shape, and the Functions section
 never gives it a result to read. Before this, the declaration took whatever
 the call left in the return register and called it a number: it printed 1, a
 wrong answer that looks like data - the very thing LANGUAGE.md:656-660 says
 the language exists to refuse.)

To ping. Print "pong".

a number called answer is ping.
Print answer.
